---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { image } from '../../lib/images';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Windows & Doors — Carpenter Meghann B"
  description="Expert installation and replacement of windows and doors in Prince Rupert, BC. Energy-efficient solutions by Red Seal Carpenter Meghann Barsalou."
>
  <section class="service-hero">
    <Picture
      src={image('portfolio/misc/exteriordoortrimandsiding.jpg')}
      widths={[768, 1280, 1920]}
      sizes="100vw"
      alt=""
      loading="eager"
    />
    <div class="service-hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-center">Carpentry Services</p>
      <h1>Windows &amp; Doors</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="service-content">
      <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/services">All services</a></p>
      <h2>Expert Window &amp; Door Installation</h2>
      <p>Windows and doors are more than just functional elements of your home — they are the threshold between your indoor comfort and the outside world. As a Red Seal Carpenter, I bring precision and care to every installation and replacement project.</p>
      <p>Living on the North Coast means dealing with heavy rain, wind, and varying temperatures. I ensure every window and door I install is properly sealed, insulated, and built to withstand our unique climate while enhancing your home's energy efficiency and curb appeal.</p>

      <h2>What I Offer</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>New window installation and replacement</li>
        <li>Exterior and interior door installation</li>
        <li>Custom trim work and finishing</li>
        <li>Weatherproofing and sealing</li>
        <li>Energy-efficient upgrades</li>
        <li>Rot repair around window and door frames</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>My Approach</h2>
      <p>I take the time to understand your needs — whether you're looking to upgrade for energy efficiency, enhance your home's appearance, or replace aging fixtures. I work with quality materials and pay attention to every detail, from the initial measurements to the final trim work. Every installation is treated with the same care I would give to my own home.</p>

      <div style="margin-top: var(--space-fluid-xl); text-align: center;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get a Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
